{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30599","headline":"和主司王起 · 李宣古","name":"和主司王起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恩光忽逐晓春生，金榜前头忝姓名。\n三感至公裨造化，重扬文德振寰瀛。\n伫爲霖雨曾相贺，半在云霄觉更荣。\n何处新诗添照灼，碧莲峰下柳间营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李宣古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}